      "side": 1,
      "message": "Beyond the issues we\u0027re discussing in the other comment, this doesn\u0027t tell you which branch the user checked out -- only information about the remotes/defaults, which doesn\u0027t necessarily match (example: https://android.googlesource.com/platform/manifest/+/build-tools/default.xml )",
