      "writtenOn": "2022-07-18T20:26:57Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This just won\u0027t work in many cases (build server, some partners, native git superproject, etc), and is likely not supportable as we move away from repo (as it would require executing tool-specific helpers).\n\nExecuting the `repo` tool could be dangerous -- do you know which one to use?",
      "parentUuid": "9011b1b0_951ef5eb",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 68,
        "startChar": 40,
        "endLine": 68,
        "endChar": 47
      },
